y so  you know we've opened up shelters we  we're continue to open up shelters and  everything's are those shelters safe we  we work sure we work to make sure the  shelters were hoping they're safe and  we're you know we have  National Guard members there we have Red  Cross there we're going to do everything  we can to keep everybody safe but you  know we I spent you know it's so  frustrating I've spent the last two days  traveling the coast to get people to  evacuate and those that elected not to  evacuate I'm very concerned about their  safety now all right governor we are  also concerned and good luck out there  thank you
 

